{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the flow as you hunt, butcher, and cook at a blisteringly fast pace in this action shop-keeping game. Hunt adorable monsters, chop colossal carcasses, and power-slice through huge chunks of flesh to serve your customers even faster. Move fast and stay sharp if you want your shop to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/65c0ee2967ea83143522e9094e58bb81.avif?t=1756782632\" data-has-big width=800 height=375 /></span><strong>Butcher</strong> - chop the guts out of giant carcasses, and sell 'em for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/479f9bd2a05956458c04f858632fd71b.avif?t=1756782632\" data-has-big width=800 height=375 /></span><strong>Cook</strong> - make the food exactly right for each customer, or process and sell appealing foods for the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/bae82c3bb39be9aa3b1ab9ab2f3bfa01.avif?t=1756782632\" data-has-big width=800 height=375 /></span><strong>Fight</strong> - slice, dice, and CHOP your enemies into delicious cuts of prime meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698900/extras/2644044f49ed6c86a5190bea719e698d.avif?t=1756782632\" data-has-big width=800 height=375 /></span><strong>Sell</strong> - rows of customers keep on coming - stay sharp, get them